# Build context for the CoC server image (Dockerfile at repo root).
# Keep .claude/ and packages/forge/resources/ — forge bundles skills from resources at build time.
# Keep packages/*/scripts/ — they are build scripts (prebuild.mjs, build-client.mjs).
